SCOPE NOTE

This MIT licence covers the material authored for this repository: the
guidelines, the edge-case log, the case studies, the platform comparison, the
schema notes, the label configurations and the scripts.

It does NOT relicense the source datasets, which keep their own terms:

  Images   UnderWater Fish Detection, Roboflow Universe v6      CC BY 4.0
  Video    Tilapia-RAS Dataset, Zenodo 10.5281/zenodo.17518786  CC BY 4.0
  Text     22 open-access MDPI aquaculture abstracts            CC BY 4.0
  Audio    EdAcc, DOI 10.7488/ds/7914                           CC BY-SA 4.0

Attribution is a condition of every one of those licences. The annotations in
this repository were created from scratch; the source datasets' original labels
were not used. Source media and native exports are not redistributed here.
